# Internal planning docs — design intent, not shipped documentation. Kept under
# .github/ because `ray publish` drops that whole directory, so nothing in here
# can reach the public monorepo. (.gitignore alone would NOT achieve that —
# `ray publish` reads no ignore file at all.)
.github/.private